## Definition

A filter $\mathcal F$ on a uniform space $(X,\mathcal U)$ is **Cauchy** if for every entourage $E\in\mathcal U$ some $A\in\mathcal F$ satisfies $A\times A\subseteq E$. Such an $A$ is an $E$-small member of $\mathcal F$.
